
&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE setCstIcms DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE setCstIcms:
    DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER pCstIcms   AS CHARACTER FORMAT 'x(03)'  NO-UNDO.

    RUN createTtItemDocEstTribut (INPUT "ICMS":U,
                                  INPUT "CST":U,
                                  INPUT pCstIcms).

    return "OK":U.
END PROCEDURE.
/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

